      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/6b165e91c33b69653baddc189b4e233d.avif?t=1770353461\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young man living in the city. Every day, you were busy with work, leading a hectic life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of such a lifestyle, you began to yearn for a slow life in a place rich in nature. At that time, you heard that a ranch in a certain rural village was being sold cheaply, so you decided to buy the ranch to start a second life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the village chief you met seems to have a favor to ask of you...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could you possibly have children with the young women in the village?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a farm life simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will control this young man, growing vegetables, raising livestock, and after work, go out to the village to get along with the women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get closer, events that deepen the relationship occur, and eventually, they may wish to have your children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/3d58af4da12ea741dfdccd1e08701e9c.avif?t=1770353461\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Life Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Romanceable Characters</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/6b165e91c33b69653baddc189b4e233d.avif?t=1770353461\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young man living in the city. Every day, you were busy with work, leading a hectic life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of such a lifestyle, you began to yearn for a slow life in a place rich in nature. At that time, you heard that a ranch in a certain rural village was being sold cheaply, so you decided to buy the ranch to start a second life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the village chief you met seems to have a favor to ask of you...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could you possibly have children with the young women in the village?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a farm life simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will control this young man, growing vegetables, raising livestock, and after work, go out to the village to get along with the women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get closer, events that deepen the relationship occur, and eventually, they may wish to have your children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659960/extras/3d58af4da12ea741dfdccd1e08701e9c.avif?t=1770353461\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Life Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Romanceable Characters</p></li></ul>",
